<title>USA: US Stockpile sells antimony, no offers for cadmium.</title>
<headline>US Stockpile sells antimony, no offers for cadmium.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 22,000 pounds of antimony to Amerway Inc for an estimated provisional market value of $21,454.</p>
<p>The Center added that it received no offers for cadmium.</p>
<p>The next receipt of offers for antimony will be on May 27.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
